{"index":114,"nameArabic":"الناس","ayahs":[{"index":1,"text":"قُلْ أَعُوذُ بِرَبِّ ٱلنَّاسِ","bismillah":"بِسْمِ ٱللَّهِ ٱلرَّحْمَٰنِ ٱلرَّحِيمِ","translation":"Say: I seek refuge in the Lord of mankind"},{"index":2,"text":"مَلِكِ ٱلنَّاسِ","translation":"The King of mankind"},{"index":3,"text":"إِلَٰهِ ٱلنَّاسِ","translation":"The god of mankind"},{"index":4,"text":"مِن شَرِّ ٱلْوَسْوَاسِ ٱلْخَنَّاسِ","translation":"From the evil of the sneaking whisperer"},{"index":5,"text":"ٱلَّذِى يُوَسْوِسُ فِى صُدُورِ ٱلنَّاسِ","translation":"Who whispereth in the hearts of mankind"},{"index":6,"text":"مِنَ ٱلْجِنَّةِ وَٱلنَّاسِ","translation":"Of the jinn and of mankind"}]}